OL,3,GNEWSARare panto programmes owned by    
OL,4,A'Freddie Mercury of his time' sell at  
OL,5,Aauction                                
OL,7,FA rare pair of pantomime programmes    
OL,8,Ffrom the private theatre of a man      
OL,9,Fdubbed "the Freddie Mercury of his     
OL,10,Ftime" have sold at auction for #3,600. 
OL,12,FThe 4th Marquess of Anglesey Henry     
OL,13,FCyril Paget, also known as the Dancing 
OL,14,FMarquess, used his family home Plas    
OL,15,FNewydd, on Anglesey, to stage lavish   
OL,16,Fproductions free for local people.     
OL,18,FHis life was recently turned into a    
OL,19,Fbiopic, with Callum Scott Howells      
OL,20,Fplaying the aristocrat.                
